hadiths[153]{hadithnumber,text}:
"731","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Ehram wala kapdon mein se kya pehne? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qameesein na pehne, amame na pehne, shalwarein na pehne, top wale libas na pehne, moze na pehne. Magar jo jootiyan na paye wo moze pehne aur unhe takhnon se neeche kaat le. Aur kapdon mein se koi cheez na pehno jise za'faran ya wars laga ho."
"732","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Arafat mein khutba dete suna: Jo jootiyan na paye wo moze pehne, aur jo tehband na paye wo shalwar pehne, ehram wale ke liye."
"733","[AI-translation] Ya'la ne Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Mujhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dikhao jab Aap par wahi nazil hoti hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ji'rana mein they aur Aap ke sath Aap ke sathiyon mein se ek jamaat thi, Aap ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Us shakhs ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai jo umra ka ehram bandhe jabke wo khushboo mein basa ho? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kuchh der khamosh rahe. Phir Aap par wahi aayi. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Ya'la ki taraf ishara farmaya. Phir Ya'la aaye jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par kapda tha jis se Aap par saya kiya gaya tha. Phir unhon ne apna sar dakhil kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) surkh chehre wale they jabke Aap kharrate le rahe they. Phir Aap se door kar diya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo kahan hai jo umra ke bare mein poochhta tha? Phir ek shakhs laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo khushboo tum mein hai use teen martaba dho, apne se jubba utaro, aur apne umre mein waisa hi karo jaisa apne hajj mein karte ho."
"734","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Madina walon ke liye Dhu al-Hulaifa, Sham walon ke liye Juhfa, Najd walon ke liye Qarn al-Manazil, Yemen walon ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar farmaya. Phir ye un ke liye hain aur jo un par se aaye un ke ghair walon mein se, jo hajj aur umra ka irada rakhe. Phir jo un se neeche ho us ka ehlal us ke ghar se hai. Aur aise hi, yahan tak ke Makkah wale us mein se ehlal karte hain."
"735","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Madina wale Dhu al-Hulaifa se ehlal karte hain, Sham wale Juhfa se, Najd wale Qarn se. Abdullah ne kaha: Aur mujhe pahuncha hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur Yemen wale Yalamlam se ehlal karte hain."
"736","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka talbiya tha: Labbaik Allahumma labbaik, labbaik la sharika laka labbaik. Beshak hamd aur naimat Tere liye hai aur badshahi, Tera koi shareek nahi."
"737","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne masjid ke paas ke siwa ehlal nahi farmaya, matlab Dhu al-Hulaifa ki masjid."
"738","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se Ubaid bin Juraij ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se kaha: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman! Main ne tumhe chaar karte dekha jo main ne tumhare sathiyon mein se kisi ko karte nahi dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Ibn Juraij! Wo kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne tumhe dekha ke tum arkan mein se Yemeni do ke siwa nahi chhute, main ne tumhe chamde ke jootey pehente dekha, main ne tumhe peele rang se rangte dekha, aur main ne tumhe dekha ke jab tum Makkah mein hote to log chaand dekh kar ehlal karte aur tum ehlal na karte yahan tak ke Tarwiya ka din hota. Abdullah ne kaha: Rahe arkan, beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Yemeni do ke siwa chhute nahi dekha. Aur rahe chamde ke jootey, beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko wo joota pehente dekha jis mein baal nahi hote, aur us mein wuzu farmate. Phir main pasand karta hun ke use pehnun. Aur rahi peeli, beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us se rangte dekha. Phir main pasand karta hun ke us se rangun. Aur raha ehlal, beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ehlal karte nahi dekha yahan tak ke Aap ki sawari Aap ko lekar khadi hoti."
"739","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Aap ke ehram ke liye khushboo lagati jab Aap ehram bandhte, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye Baitullah ka tawaf karne se pehle."
"740","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Goya main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki maang mein khushboo ki chamak dekh rahi hun jabke Aap ehram bandhe they."
"741","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Muhammad bin al-Muntashir ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se poochha aur un se Ibn Umar ka qaul zikr kiya: Main pasand nahi karta ke ehram bandhe subah karun jabke mujh se khushboo tapak rahi ho. To Aisha ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khushboo lagayi. Phir Aap ne apni biwiyon mein phera lagaya. Phir ehram bandhe subah ki."
"742","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'b bin Jaththama al-Laithi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jungli gadha hadiya kiya, jabke Aap Abwa ya Waddan mein they. To Aap ne use unhe lautaya. Phir jab Aap ne un ke chehre mein jo tha dekha to farmaya: Hum ne use sirf is liye lautaya ke hum ehram bandhe hain."
"743","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Qaha mein they, hum mein ehram wale aur ghair ehram wale they. Phir main ne apne sathiyon ko dekha ke wo kisi cheez ko dekh rahe hain. Phir main ne dekha to jungli gadha tha, matlab. Phir us ka koda gira. To unhon ne kaha: Hum tumhari us par kisi cheez se madad nahi karenge, kyunke hum ehram bandhe hain. Phir main ne use pakda aur liya. Phir teele ke peechhe se gadhe ke paas aaya aur use maar giraya. Phir use apne sathiyon ke paas laya. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Khayiye. Aur un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Na khayiye. Phir main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Wo hamare samne they. Phir main ne Aap se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use khayiye, halal hai."
"744","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada se Abdullah bin Abi Qatada ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Hudaibiya ke saal nikle. Phir un ke sathi ehram bandhe aur unhon ne ehram na bandha. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar di gayi ke dushman Aap par hamla karne wala hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chale. Phir jab main un ke sathiyon ke sath tha to un mein se kuchh ek doosre ki taraf hanse. Phir main ne dekha to main jungli gadhe ke paas tha. Phir main ne us par hamla kiya aur use neze se mara aur use rok liya. Aur un se madad mangi to unhon ne meri madad se inkar kiya. Phir hum ne us ke gosht mein se khaya. Aur hamein dar hua ke hum kat jayenge. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko talash kiya, apne ghode ko daudata aur chalta. Phir main Bani Ghifar mein se ek shakhs se aadhi raat mein mila. Main ne kaha: Tum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kahan chhora? Us ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko Ta'hun mein chhora jabke Wo Suqya mein dopahar guzar rahe they. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tumhare ghar wale tumhe salam aur Allah ki rehmat kehte hain. Beshak unhe dar hua hai ke wo tum se pehle kat jayenge, to un ka intezar farmayiye. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne jungli gadha mara hai aur mere paas us mein se bacha hua hai. To Aap ne qaum se farmaya: Khayiye jabke wo ehram bandhe they."
"745","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hajj ke liye nikle. Phir wo Aap ke sath nikle. Phir Aap ne un mein se ek giroh ko phera jis mein Abu Qatada they. Phir farmaya: Samandar ka kinara pakdo yahan tak ke hum milein. Phir unhon ne samandar ka kinara pakda. Phir jab wo laute to sab ehram bandhe, siwaye Abu Qatada ke, unhon ne ehram na bandha. Phir jab wo chal rahe they to unhon ne jungli gadhe dekhe. Phir Abu Qatada ne gadhon par hamla kiya aur un mein se gadhi maar girayi. Phir wo utre aur us ke gosht mein se khaya. Aur unhon ne kaha: Kya hum shikar ka gosht khayein jabke hum ehram bandhe hain? Phir hum ne gadhi ke gosht mein se jo bacha usے uthaya. Phir jab wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye to unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum ne ehram bandha tha, jabke Abu Qatada ne ehram na bandha tha. Phir hum ne jungli gadhe dekhe. Phir Abu Qatada ne un par hamla kiya aur un mein se gadhi maar girayi. Phir hum utre aur us ke gosht mein se khaya. Phir hum ne kaha: Kya hum shikar ka gosht khayein jabke hum ehram bandhe hain? Phir hum ne us ke gosht mein se jo bacha usے uthaya. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ne use us par hamla karne ka hukm diya ya us ki taraf ishara kiya? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir us ke gosht mein se jo bacha usے khayiye."
"746","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch, sab fasiq hain, Haram mein qatl kiye jayenge: Kawwa, cheel, bichchhu, chooha aur kaatne wala kutta."
"747","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch, unhe qatl karne wale par koi harj nahi: Kawwa, cheel, chooha, bichchhu aur kaatne wala kutta."
"748","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch, ehram wale par unhe qatl karne mein koi gunah nahi."
"749","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Ujra (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Shayad tumhare keede tumhe takleef dete hain? Unhon ne arz kiya: Haan Ya Rasulullah! Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apna sar mundwao, teen din roza rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao, ya bakri zibah karo."
"750","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Ujra se Abdullah bin Ma'qil ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ka'b bin Ujra ke paas is masjid mein baitha, matlab Kufa ki masjid. Phir main ne un se [roze ka fidya] ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya gaya jabke juwein mere chehre par bikhri hui thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Main na samajhta tha ke mushqqat tumhe yahan pahunchayegi. Kya tum bakri pate ho? Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Teen din roza rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao, har miskeen ke liye khane ka aadha sa', aur apna sar mundwao. Phir ye mere bare mein khaas taur par nazil hui, aur tumhare liye aam hai."
"751","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Buhaina (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne seengi lagwayi jabke Aap ehram bandhe they, Lahy Jamal mein, apne sar ke darmiyan."
"752","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se Abdullah bin Hunain ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Abdullah bin al-Abbas aur Miswar bin Makhrama ne Abwa mein ikhtilaf kiya. To Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha: Ehram wala apna sar dhoye. Aur Miswar ne kaha: Ehram wala apna sar na dhoye. Phir Abdullah bin al-Abbas ne mujhe Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ki taraf bheja. Phir main ne unhe do lakdiyon ke darmiyan ghusl karte paya jabke unhe kapde se parda kiya gaya tha. Phir main ne unhe salam kiya. To unhon ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Main ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Hunain hun. Mujhe tumhare paas Abdullah bin al-Abbas ne bheja hai, tum se poochhta hun ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ehram bandhe apna sar kaise dhote they? Phir Abu Ayyub ne kapde par apna hath rakha aur use jhukaya yahan tak ke mujhe un ka sar zahir ho gaya. Phir unhon ne pani dalne wale insan se kaha: Dalo. Phir us ne un ke sar par dala. Phir unhon ne apne sar ko apne dono hathon se harkat di. Phir unhe aage laya aur peechhe le gaya. Aur farmaya: Main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisa karte dekha."
"753","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ek shakhs Arafa mein thehra tha to wo apni sawari se gira aur usے kuchal diya, ya kaha usے kuchal diya. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do, use do kapdon mein kafan do, use khushboo na lagao, us ka sar na dhanpo. Kyunke wo Qayamat ke din labbaik kehte uthaya jayega."
"754","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Dubaa'a bint al-Zubair ke paas dakhil hue. Phir Aap ne un se farmaya: Shayad tum ne hajj ka irada kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main apne aap ko beemar ke siwa nahi pati. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Hajj karo aur shart lagao. Kaho: Ae Allah! Mera halal hona wahan hai jahan Tune mujhe roka. Aur wo Miqdad bin al-Aswad ke nikah mein thein."
"755","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Hajjat al-Wada mein nikle. Phir hum ne umra ka ehlal kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas hadi ho use chahiye ke hajj ke sath umre ka ehlal kare, phir halal na ho yahan tak ke un dono se halal ho. Phir main Makkah aayi jabke main haiz se thi. Aur main ne Baitullah ka tawaf na kiya aur Safa Marwa ke darmiyan na kiya. Phir main ne is ki Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikayat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Apna sar kholo, kanghi karo, hajj ka ehlal karo aur umra chhor do. Phir main ne aisa kiya. Phir jab hum ne hajj poora kiya to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr ke sath Tan'im ki taraf bheja. Phir main ne umra kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye tumhare umre ki jagah hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jinhon ne umre ka ehlal kiya tha unhon ne Baitullah aur Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf kiya, phir halal ho gaye. Phir unhon ne Mina se lautne ke baad ek tawaf kiya. Aur rahe jinhon ne hajj aur umra jama kiya, unhon ne to ek tawaf kiya."
"756","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Hajjat al-Wada mein nikle. Phir hum mein se jis ne umre ka ehlal kiya, jis ne hajj ka ehlal kiya. Phir hum Makkah aaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo umre ka ehram bandhe aur hadi na laye wo halal ho jaye. Aur jo umre ka ehram bandhe aur hadi laye wo halal na ho yahan tak ke apni hadi zibah karke halal ho. Aur jo hajj ka ehlal kare wo apna hajj poora kare. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe haiz aaya aur main haiz se rahi yahan tak ke Arafa ka din tha, jabke main ne umre ke siwa ehlal na kiya tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apna sar kholun, kanghi karun, hajj ka ehlal karun aur umra chhor dun. Phir main ne aisa kiya yahan tak ke main ne apna hajj poora kiya. Phir Aap ne mere sath Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr ko bheja. Aur mujhe hukm diya ke main apne umre ki jagah Tan'im se umra karun."
"757","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum nikle aur hajj ke siwa na samajhte. Phir jab hum Sarif mein they to mujhe haiz aaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main ro rahi thi. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kya hua? Kya tumhe nifas aaya? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye wo mamla hai jo Allah ne Banaat Adam par likha hai. Phir wo karo jo haji karta hai, magar Baitullah ka tawaf na karo. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se gaay qurban ki."
"758","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum hajj ka ehlal karke nikle, hajj ke mahinon aur hurmat wale mahinon mein. Phir hum Sarif mein utre. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne sathiyon se farmaya: Jis ke paas hadi na ho aur wo chahe ke use umra banaye to aisa kare. Aur jis ke paas hadi ho wo na kare. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sathiyon mein se taqat wale mardon ke paas hadi thi. Phir un ke liye umra na tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main ro rahi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kya rulata hai? Main ne arz kiya: Main ne tumhe apne sathiyon se jo tum ne kaha suna, phir mujhe umre se rok diya gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Main ne arz kiya: Main namaz nahi parhti. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe nuqsan nahi dega. Tum Banaat Adam mein se ho. Tum par wo likha gaya jo un par likha gaya. Phir apne hajj mein raho, shayad Allah tumhe ata farmaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main rahi yahan tak ke hum Mina se laute. Phir hum Muhassab mein utre. Phir Aap ne Abd al-Rahman ko bulaya aur farmaya: Apni behan ke sath Haram se niklo. Phir wo umre ka ehlal kare. Phir tum dono apne tawaf se farigh ho jao, main yahan tumhara intezar karunga. Phir hum aadhi raat mein aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum farigh ho gaye? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Aap ne apne sathiyon mein kooch ka elan farmaya. Phir log kooch kar gaye. Aur jis ne Fajr ki namaz se pehle raat mein tawaf kiya. Phir Aap Madina ki taraf mutawajjah hokar nikle."
"759","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath nikle aur hum use hajj ke siwa na samajhte. Phir jab hum aaye to hum ne Baitullah ka tawaf kiya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm diya ke jo hadi na laya ho wo halal ho jaye. Phir jo hadi na laya tha wo halal ho gaya. Aur Aap ki biwiyan hadi na layi thein to wo halal ho gayein. Aisha ne kaha: Phir mujhe haiz aaya to main ne Baitullah ka tawaf na kiya. Phir jab Hasba ki raat thi to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Log umra aur hajj ke sath lautenge aur main hajj ke sath lautungi? Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum ne un raaton mein tawaf na kiya jab hum Makkah aaye they? Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Apne bhai ke sath Tan'im jao aur umre ka ehlal karo. Phir tumhara wada falan aur falan hai. Safiyya ne kaha: Main unhe rokne wali hi samajhti hun. Aap ne farmaya: Banjar, mundi hui? Kya tum ne Nahr ke din tawaf na kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi, kooch karo. Aisha ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe mile jabke Wo Makkah se chadh rahe they aur main us par utar rahi thi. Ya main chadh rahi thi aur Wo us se utar rahe they."
"760","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe hukm diya ke wo Aisha ko sawari par bithayein aur unhe Tan'im se umra karayein."
"761","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se Ata ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko un ke sath chand logon mein suna, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne ehlal kiya, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba, hajj mein khalis, us ke sath umra nahi. Ata ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Dhu al-Hijja ki guzri hui chauthi ki subah tashreef laye. Phir jab hum aaye to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke hum halal ho jayein. Aur farmaya: Halal ho jao aur aurton se faida uthao. Ata ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: Aur Aap ne un par lazim na farmaya, lekin un ke liye unhe halal farmaya. Phir Aap ko khabar pahunchi ke hum kehte hain: Jab hamare aur Arafa ke darmiyan sirf paanch din hain to Aap ne hamein hukm diya ke hum apni biwiyon ki taraf halal ho jayein. Phir hum Arafa aayein jabke hamari sharmgahein mazi tapak rahi hon. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Jabir apne hath se aise kehte, aur use harkat dete. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue aur farmaya: Beshak tum jante ho ke main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala, sab se sachcha aur sab se nek hun. Aur agar meri hadi na hoti to main halal ho jata jaisa tum halal hote ho. Phir halal ho jao. Phir agar main apne mamle mein jo peechhe hai use aage karun jo aage hai use peechhe kiya, to main hadi na lata. Phir hum halal ho gaye aur hum ne suna aur itaat ki."
"762","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ali ko hukm diya ke wo apne ehram par qayam rahein. Jabir ne kaha: Phir Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) apni kamayi ke sath aaye. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Ae Ali! Tum ne kis se ehlal kiya? Unhon ne arz kiya: Jis se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ehlal kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Phir hadi do aur ehram mein thehro jaisa tum ho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Ali ne Aap ke liye hadi di."
"763","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aur Aap ke sahaba ne hajj ka ehlal kiya, jabke un mein se kisi ke paas hadi na thi, siwaye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Talha ke. Aur Ali Yemen se aaye they aur un ke paas hadi thi. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne us se ehlal kiya jis se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ehlal kiya. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne sahaba ko ijazat di ke wo use umra banayein, Baitullah ka tawaf karein, phir baal katwayein aur halal ho jayein, siwaye jis ke paas hadi ho. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hum Mina ki taraf jayein jabke hum mein se ek ki sharmgah tapak rahi ho? Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar main apne mamle mein jo peechhe hai use aage karun jo aage hai use peechhe kiya, to main hadi na lata. Aur agar mere paas hadi na hoti to main halal ho jata. Aur Aisha ko haiz aaya. Phir unhon ne tamam manasik ada kiye, magar unhon ne Baitullah ka tawaf na kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab wo paak huein aur tawaf kiya to unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum umra aur hajj ke sath jaoge aur main hajj ke sath jaungi? Phir Aap ne Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr ko hukm diya ke wo un ke sath Tan'im ki taraf niklein. Phir unhon ne hajj ke baad Dhu al-Hijja mein umra kiya. Aur Suraqa bin Malik bin Ju'shum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mile jabke Wo Aqaba mein they aur use kankariyan mar rahe they. Phir us ne arz kiya: Kya ye tumhare liye khaas hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke hamesha ke liye."
"764","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai ke log jahiliyat mein nange tawaf karte, siwaye Hums ke. Aur Hums Quraish aur un ki aulad hain. Aur Hums logon par ehsan jata te: Aadmi aadmi ko kapde deta jis mein tawaf karta, aurat aurat ko kapde deti jis mein tawaf karti. Phir jise Hums na dete wo Baitullah ka nanga tawaf karta. Aur logon ki jamaat Arafat se laut-ti, aur Hums Jam se laut-te. Aur Aisha se riwayat hai ke ye ayat Hums ke bare mein nazil hui [phir wahan se lauto jahan se log laute]. Unhon ne kaha: Wo Jam se laut-te, phir unhe Arafat ki taraf dhakela gaya."
"765","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mera oont gum ho gaya. Phir main Arafa ke din use talash karne gaya. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Arafa mein thehre dekha. Phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ye to Hums mein se hain. Phir un ka yahan kya kaam?"
"766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Wo Batha mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne hajj kiya? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kis se ehlal kiya? Main ne arz kiya: Labbaik, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ehlal jaise ehlal se. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne acha kiya. Jao aur Baitullah aur Safa Marwa ka tawaf karo. Phir main Bani Qais ki aurton mein se ek aurat ke paas aaya to us ne mera sar dhoya. Phir main ne hajj ka ehlal kiya. Phir main logon ko is ka fatwa deta raha yahan tak ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ki khilafat. Phir main ne un se is ka zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Agar hum Allah ki kitab lein to wo hamein poora karne ka hukm deti hai. Aur agar hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sunnat lein to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) halal na hue yahan tak ke hadi apni jagah pahunchi."
"767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mut'a ki ayat Allah ki kitab mein nazil hui. Phir hum ne use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath kiya. Aur use haram karne wala Quran nazil na hua, aur Aap ne wafat tak is se mana na farmaya. Ek shakhs ne apni raay se jo chaha kaha."
"768","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hajjat al-Wada mein umre se hajj tak tamattu kiya aur hadi di. Phir Aap hadi Dhu al-Hulaifa se sath laye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ibtida farmayi aur umre ka ehlal farmaya, phir hajj ka. Phir logon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath umre se hajj tak tamattu kiya. Phir logon mein se koi hadi laya aur hadi sath laya, aur un mein se koi hadi na laya. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makkah tashreef laye to logon se farmaya: Tum mein se jo hadi laya wo kisi cheez ke liye halal nahi hoga jo us par haram hui yahan tak ke apna hajj poora kare. Aur tum mein se jo hadi na laya wo Baitullah aur Safa Marwa ka tawaf kare, baal katwaye aur halal ho jaye. Phir hajj ka ehlal kare. Phir jo hadi na paye wo hajj mein teen din roza rakhe aur saat jab apne ghar walon ki taraf laute. Phir Aap ne tawaf kiya jab Makkah tashreef laye, aur sab se pehle rukn ko chhua. Phir teen pheron mein daud kar chale aur chaar mein paidal chale. Phir jab Baitullah ke tawaf se farigh hue to Maqam ke paas do rakatein parhein. Phir salam phera. Phir phire aur Safa ke paas aaye. Phir Safa Marwa ka saat pheron mein tawaf kiya. Phir kisi cheez se halal na hue jo us par haram hui yahan tak ke apna hajj poora kiya aur Nahr ke din apni hadi zibah ki. Aur tawaf-e-ifaza kiya aur Baitullah ka tawaf kiya. Phir har cheez se halal ho gaye jo us par haram hui thi. Aur waisa hi kiya jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiya, jis ne hadi di aur logon mein se hadi sath layi."
"769","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aisha ne unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Aap ke umre se hajj tak tamattu ke bare mein khabar di. Phir logon ne Aap ke sath tamattu kiya, Ibn Umar ki pichhli hadith jaisi [number 768]."
"770","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Logon ka kya haal hai ke wo umre se halal ho gaye aur tum apne umre se halal na hue? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne apna sar jamaya hai aur apni hadi ko haar pehnaya hai. Phir main halal nahi hunga yahan tak ke zibah karun."
"771","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab wo fitne mein umra karte hue Makkah ki taraf nikle: Agar mujhe Baitullah se rok diya gaya to hum waisa hi karenge jaisa hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath kiya. Phir unhon ne umre ka ehlal kiya, is liye ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hudaibiya ke saal umre ka ehlal kiya tha. Phir Abdullah bin Umar ne apne mamle mein ghaur kiya aur farmaya: Un dono ka mamla to ek hai. Phir apne sathiyon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Un dono ka mamla to ek hai. Main tumhe gawah banata hun ke main ne hajj ko umre ke sath wajib kar liya hai. Phir unhon ne un dono ka ek tawaf kiya. Aur dekha ke wo usے kafi hai aur hadi di."
"772","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne us saal hajj ka irada kiya jis saal Hajjaj Ibn al-Zubair par utara. To un se kaha gaya: Beshak logon ke darmiyan ladayi hone wali hai aur hamein dar hai ke wo tumhe rokenge. To unhon ne kaha: [Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umda namuna hai]. Phir main waisa hi karunga jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiya. Beshak main tumhe gawah banata hun ke main ne umra wajib kar liya hai. Phir nikle yahan tak ke jab Baida ke zahir mein they to farmaya: Hajj aur umre ka mamla to ek hai. Main tumhe gawah banata hun ke main ne apne umre ke sath hajj wajib kar liya hai. Aur hadi di jo Qudaid mein khareedi thi. Aur is par izafa na kiya. Phir na zibah kiya, na kisi cheez se halal hue jo us par haram hui thi, na sar mundwaya na baal katwaye yahan tak ke Nahr ka din tha. Phir zibah kiya aur sar mundwaya. Aur dekha ke unhon ne apne pehle tawaf se hajj aur umre ka tawaf poora kar liya. Aur Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aisa hi kiya."
"773","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Anas se Bakr ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Umar se zikr kiya ke Anas ne unhe bayan kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne umre aur hajj ka ehlal kiya. To unhon ne kaha [Ibn Umar]: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hajj ka ehlal kiya aur hum ne Aap ke sath us ka ehlal kiya. Phir jab hum Makkah aaye to Aap ne farmaya: Jis ke paas hadi na ho use chahiye ke use umra banaye. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hadi thi. Phir hamare paas Ali bin Abi Talib Yemen se hajj karte aaye. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne kis se ehlal kiya? Kyunke hamare sath tumhare ghar wale hain. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne us se ehlal kiya jis se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ehlal kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Phir roko, kyunke hamare paas hadi hai."
"774","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Amr bin Dinar ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Ibn Umar se us shakhs ke bare mein poochha jo Baitullah ka umre ka tawaf kare aur Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf na kare, kya wo apni biwi ke paas aaye? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye aur Baitullah ka saat pheron mein tawaf kiya, Maqam ke peechhe do rakatein parhein, Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf kiya [aur beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umda namuna hai]."
"775","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Asma se Muhammad bin Abd al-Rahman bin Naufal al-Qurashi ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Urwa bin al-Zubair se poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hajj kiya. Phir mujhe Aisha ne khabar di ke Aap ne sab se pehle jis se ibtida farmayi jab Aap tashreef laye wo ye tha ke Aap ne wuzu farmaya, phir Baitullah ka tawaf kiya, phir umra na tha. Phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne hajj kiya. Phir sab se pehle jis se ibtida farmayi wo Baitullah ka tawaf tha, phir umra na tha. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu), is jaisa. Phir Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne hajj kiya. Phir main ne unhe dekha ke sab se pehle jis se ibtida farmayi wo Baitullah ka tawaf tha, phir umra na tha. Phir Muawiya aur Abdullah bin Umar. Phir main ne apne walid Zubair bin al-Awwam ke sath hajj kiya. Phir sab se pehle jis se ibtida farmayi wo Baitullah ka tawaf tha, phir umra na tha. Phir main ne Muhajirin aur Ansar ko aisa karte dekha, phir umra na tha. Phir aakhri jisے main ne aisa karte dekha Ibn Umar, phir unhon ne use umre se na toda. Aur ye Ibn Umar un ke paas hain. Phir wo un se nahi poochhte aur na guzre hue mein se kisi se ke wo kis cheez se ibtida karte they yahan tak ke wo Baitullah ke tawaf se apne qadam rakhein, phir halal na hon. Aur beshak main ne apni walida aur khala ko dekha jab wo aatin to Baitullah se pehle kisi cheez se ibtida na karteen, us ka tawaf karteen, phir halal na hotin. Aur beshak mujhe meri walida ne khabar di ke unhon ne, un ki behan, Zubair aur falan falan ne umre ka ehlal kiya. Phir jab unhon ne rukn ko chhua to halal ho gaye."
"776","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr se Abdullah maula Asma bint Abi Bakr ke hawale se riwayat hai ke wo Asma ko kehte sunte, jab bhi wo Hajun se guzartin: Allah Muhammad par rehmat farmaye. Beshak hum Aap ke sath yahan utre jabke hum us din halke they, hamari sawariyan kam thein, hamare toshe kam they. Phir main ne, meri behan Aisha, Zubair aur falan falan ne umra kiya. Phir jab hum ne Baitullah ko chhua to halal ho gaye. Phir hum ne shaam mein hajj ka ehlal kiya."
"777","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sahaba Dhu al-Hijja ki guzri hui chauthi ki subah ke liye tashreef laye, hajj ka talbiya kehte hue. Phir Aap ne unhe hukm diya ke use umra banayein, siwaye jis ke paas hadi ho."
"778","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Abu Jamra Nasr bin Imran al-Duba'i ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne tamattu kiya to logon ne mujhe mana kiya. Phir main ne Ibn Abbas se poochha to unhon ne mujhe hukm diya. Phir main ne khwab mein dekha goya ek shakhs mujh se kehta hai: Hajj mabroor aur umra maqbool. Phir main ne Ibn Abbas ko khabar di. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sunnat. Phir unhon ne mujh se kaha: Mere paas thehro, main tumhare liye apne maal mein se hissa banaunga. Shu'ba ne kaha [us se rawi]: Phir main ne kaha: Kyun? Unhon ne kaha: Us khwab ke liye jo tum ne dekha."
"779","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Ibn Juraij ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya: Jab Baitullah ka tawaf kare to halal ho gaya. Phir main ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne ye kahan se kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ke qaul se [phir us ka halal hona Baitullah tak hai]. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke apne sahaba ko hukm se ke wo Hajjat al-Wada mein halal ho jayein. Main ne kaha: Ye to Arafa ke baad tha. Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas use pehle aur baad mein dekhte they."
"780","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baal qainchi se katwaye."
"781","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Yemen se tashreef laye. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kis se ehlal kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Jis se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ehlal kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar mere paas hadi na hoti to main halal ho jata."
"782","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Dhu al-Qa'da mein chaar umre kiye, siwaye jisے Aap ne apne hajj ke sath umra kiya: Aap ka Hudaibiya se umra, agle saal se, Ji'rana se jahan Hunain ki ghaneematein taqseem ki, aur apne hajj ke sath umra."
"783","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se kaha gaya: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kitni ladaiyan ladein? Unhon ne kaha: Unnees. Kaha gaya: Tum ne Aap ke sath kitni ladein? Unhon ne kaha: Satrah. Kaha gaya: Un mein se pehli kaun si thi? Unhon ne kaha: Usaira ya Ushair."
"784","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unnees ladaiyan ladein. Aur Aap ne hijrat ke baad ek hajj kiya, us ke baad hajj na kiya, Hajjat al-Wada."
"785","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar aur Aisha se Mujahid ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Urwa bin al-Zubair masjid mein dakhil hue. Phir Abdullah bin Umar Aisha ke hujre ke paas baithe they. Aur log masjid mein Chasht ki namaz parh rahe they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne un se un ki namaz ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Bid'at. Phir unhon ne un se kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kitne umre kiye? Unhon ne kaha: Chaar, un mein se ek Rajab mein. Phir hum ne unhe jawab dena na-pasand kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hum ne Umm al-Muminin Aisha ke hujre mein miswak ki awaz suni. Phir Urwa ne kaha: Ae ammi-jaan, ae Umm al-Muminin! Kya tum nahi sunteen jo Abu Abd al-Rahman kehte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kya kehte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaar umre kiye, un mein se ek Rajab mein. Unhon ne kaha: Allah Abu Abd al-Rahman par rehem farmaye. Aap ne koi umra nahi kiya magar wo hazir they. Aur Aap ne Rajab mein kabhi umra nahi kiya."
"786","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansar ki ek aurat se farmaya: Tumhe hamare sath hajj karne se kya rokta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas pani dhone wala oont tha. Phir falan ke baap aur us ke bete [us ke shohar aur bete ke liye] us par sawar hue, aur pani dhone wala oont chhora jis par hum pani dhote hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Ramazan ho to us mein umra karo. Kyunke Ramazan mein umra hajj hai, ya is jaisa jo Aap ne farmaya."
"787","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Darakht wale raste se nikalte aur Muarras wale raste se dakhil hote."
"788","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) upar wali ghati se dakhil hote aur neeche wali ghati se nikalte."
"789","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Makkah tashreef laye to us ke upar se dakhil hue aur us ke neeche se nikle."
"790","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fatah ke saal Kada se dakhil hue aur Kuda se nikle, Makkah ke upar se."
"791","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Dhu Tuwa mein raat guzarte yahan tak ke subah hoti, phir Makkah dakhil hote. Aur Ibn Umar aisa karte."
"792","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Dhu Tuwa mein utarte aur raat guzarte yahan tak ke subah hoti. Fajr parhte jab Makkah tashreef late. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki us namaz ki jagah mote teele par thi, us masjid mein nahi jo wahan banayi gayi. Lekin us se neeche mote teele par."
"793","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us pahad ke dono dahano ka istiqbal kiya jo Aap ke aur lambe pahad ke darmiyan Kaaba ki taraf hai. Phir us masjid ko jo wahan banayi gayi, masjid ke bayein teele ke kinare par banaya. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ki jagah us se neeche siyah teele par, teele se dus gaz ya is ke qareeb chhoro, phir namaz parho us pahad ke dono dahano ka istiqbal karte hue jo tumhare aur Kaaba ke darmiyan hai."
"794","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Baitullah ka pehla tawaf karte to teen pheron mein daud kar chalte aur chaar mein paidal chalte. Aur Wo wadi ke pet mein daudte jab Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf karte."
"795","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sahaba tashreef laye. Phir mushrikon ne kaha: Beshak tumhare paas aate hain jabke unhe Yasrib ke bukhar ne kamzor kar diya hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe hukm diya ke wo teen pheron mein daud kar chalein, aur dono ruknon ke darmiyan paidal chalein. Aur Aap ko unhe hukm dene se sirf un par narmi ne roka ke wo tamam pheron mein daud kar chalein."
"796","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Baitullah aur Safa Marwa ke darmiyan sirf is liye daud lagayi taake mushrikon ko apni quwwat dikhayein."
"797","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne in dono ruknon ko chhuna sakhti aur narmi mein nahi chhora jab se main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko unhe chhute dekha."
"798","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Abu al-Sha'tha ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Aur jo Baitullah mein se kisi cheez se bache. Aur Muawiya arkan ko chhute they. Phir Ibn Abbas ne un se kaha: Beshak in dono ruknon ko nahi chhua jata."
"799","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Hajar Aswad ke paas aaye aur use bosa diya. Phir farmaya: Beshak main janta hun ke tum pathar ho, na nuqsan dete ho na faida. Aur agar main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko tumhe bosa dete na dekha hota to main tumhe bosa na deta."
"800","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hajjat al-Wada mein oont par tawaf kiya, rukn ko chhadi se chhute hue."
"801","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikayat ki ke main beemar hun. Aap ne farmaya: Logon ke peechhe se tawaf karo jabke tum sawari par ho. Phir main ne tawaf kiya jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Baitullah ke pehlu mein namaz parh rahe they, Tur aur likhi hui kitab parhte hue."
"802","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Aisha se kaha, jabke main us din kam-umr tha: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ke qaul [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Phir jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi gunah nahi] ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai? Phir main kisi par kuchh nahi dekhta ke wo un dono ka tawaf na kare. To Aisha ne kaha: Hargiz nahi. Agar wo hota jaisa tum kehte to hota ke un dono ka tawaf na karne mein koi gunah nahi. Ye ayat to Ansar ke bare mein nazil hui. Wo Manat ke liye ehlal karte they, aur Manat Qudaid ke samne thi. Aur wo Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf karne se bachte they. Phir jab Islam aaya to unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ke bare mein poochha. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Phir jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi gunah nahi]."
"803","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se poochha aur un se arz kiya: Allah Ta'ala ke qaul [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Phir jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi gunah nahi] ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai? Allah ki qasam! Kisi par Safa Marwa ka tawaf na karne mein koi gunah nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Ae bhanje! Tum ne bura kaha. Beshak ye ayat agar hoti jaisa tum ne us ki taweel ki to hoti ke un dono ka tawaf na karne mein koi gunah nahi. Lekin ye Ansar ke bare mein nazil hui. Wo musalman hone se pehle Manat taghoot ke liye ehlal karte they jis ki wo Mushallal ke paas ibadat karte they. Phir jo ehlal karta wo Safa Marwa ka tawaf karne se bachta. Phir jab wo musalman hue to unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ke bare mein poochha. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum Safa Marwa ke darmiyan tawaf karne se bachte they. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain] ayat tak. Aisha ne kaha: Aur beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono ke darmiyan tawaf ko sunnat banaya. Phir kisi ke liye un dono ke darmiyan tawaf chhorna jayez nahi. [Zuhri ne kaha, hadith ke rawi]: Phir main ne Abu Bakr bin Abd al-Rahman ko khabar di. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak ye aisa ilm hai jo main ne nahi suna tha. Aur beshak main ne ilm walon mein se mardon ko zikr karte suna ke log, siwaye jisے Aisha ne zikr kiya, jo Manat ka ehlal karte they, wo sab Safa Marwa ka tawaf karte they. Phir jab Allah Ta'ala ne Baitullah ka tawaf zikr kiya aur Quran mein Safa Marwa ka zikr na kiya to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hum Safa Marwa ka tawaf karte they. Aur beshak Allah ne Baitullah ka tawaf nazil farmaya aur Safa ka zikr na farmaya. To kya hum par Safa Marwa ka tawaf karne mein koi harj hai? Phir Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain] ayat tak. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Phir main sunta hun ke ye ayat dono girohon ke bare mein nazil hui: Un ke bare mein jo jahiliyat mein Safa Marwa ka tawaf karne se bachte they, aur jo tawaf karte phir Islam mein un dono ka tawaf karne se bachte, is liye ke Allah Ta'ala ne Baitullah ke tawaf ka hukm diya aur Safa ka zikr na farmaya yahan tak ke us ka zikr Baitullah ke tawaf ke zikr ke baad farmaya."
"804","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Asim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik se kaha: Kya tum Safa Marwa ke darmiyan daudne ko na-pasand karte they? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, kyunke wo jahiliyat ki nishaniyon mein se thi. Yahan tak ke Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Phir jo Baitullah ka hajj ya umra kare us par un dono ka tawaf karne mein koi gunah nahi]."
"805","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid aur Fadl se Kuraib maula Ibn Abbas ke hawale se, Usama bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe Arafat se sawar tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ghati pahunche jo Muzdalifa se pehle bayein taraf hai to Aap ne oont bithaya. Phir peshab farmaya. Phir aaye to main ne Aap par wuzu ka pani dala. Phir Aap ne halka wuzu farmaya. Phir main ne arz kiya: Namaz Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Namaz tumhare samne hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawar hue yahan tak ke Muzdalifa tashreef laye. Phir namaz parhi. Phir Fadl Jam ki subah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe sawar hue. Kuraib ne kaha: Phir mujhe Abdullah bin Abbas ne Fadl se khabar di ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) talbiya kehte rahe yahan tak ke Jamra pahunche."
"806","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Muhammad bin Abi Bakr al-Thaqafi ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se poochha jab hum Mina se Arafat ki taraf subah ja rahe they, talbiya ke bare mein ke tum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath kya karte they? Unhon ne kaha: Talbiya kehne wala talbiya kehta, us par inkar na kiya jata. Aur takbeer kehne wala takbeer kehta, us par inkar na kiya jata."
"807","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Arafa se laute yahan tak ke jab ghati mein they to utre aur peshab farmaya. Phir wuzu farmaya aur poora wuzu na farmaya. Phir main ne arz kiya: Namaz Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Namaz tumhare samne hai. Phir sawar hue. Phir jab Muzdalifa tashreef laye to utre aur wuzu farmaya aur poora wuzu farmaya. Phir iqamat kahi gayi. Phir Maghrib parhi. Phir har insan ne apna oont apni jagah bithaya. Phir Isha ki iqamat kahi gayi. Phir namaz parhi aur un dono ke darmiyan namaz na parhi."
"808","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Usama se poochha gaya jabke main baitha tha: Hajjat al-Wada mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chalna kaisa tha jab Aap laute? Unhon ne kaha: Wo darmiyani chaal chalte. Phir jab khuli jagah pate to tez chalte."
"809","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hajjat al-Wada mein Maghrib aur Isha ko Muzdalifa mein jama farmaya."
"810","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Maghrib aur Isha ko jama farmate jab safar Aap ko jaldi mein dalta."
"811","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko namaz apne waqt ke siwa parhte nahi dekha, magar do namazein: Maghrib aur Isha ko jama farmaya, aur Fajr apne waqt se pehle parhi."
"812","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Muzdalifa utre. Phir Sauda ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangi ke wo logon ki bheed se pehle jayein, jabke wo sust aurat thein. Phir Aap ne unhe ijazat de di. Phir wo logon ki bheed se pehle gayein. Aur hum thehre yahan tak ke hum ne subah ki, phir hum Aap ke jane se gaye. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangti jaisa Sauda ne ijazat mangi thi, ye mujhe khushi se zyada mehboob hai."
"813","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma se Abdullah maula Asma ke hawale se, Asma se riwayat hai ke wo Jam ki raat Muzdalifa mein utrein. Phir khadi hokar namaz parhne lagein. Phir kuchh der namaz parhi phir farmaya: Ae mere bete! Kya chaand ghuroob ho gaya? Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Phir kuchh der namaz parhi phir farmaya: Kya chaand ghuroob ho gaya? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir kooch karo. Phir hum ne kooch kiya aur chale yahan tak ke Jamra ko kankariyan marein. Phir lauti aur apne maskan mein Fajr parhi. Phir main ne un se kaha: Ae mohtarma! Main hamein andhera kiye ke siwa nahi dekhta. Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere bete! Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kamzor aurton ko ijazat di thi."
"814","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main un mein se hun jinhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Muzdalifa ki raat apne ghar walon ke kamzoron mein aage bheja."
"815","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo apne ghar walon ke kamzoron ko aage bhejte. Phir wo Muzdalifa mein Mash'ar al-Haram ke paas raat mein theharte. Phir Allah ko yaad karte jo unhe zahir hota. Phir imam ke theharne aur jane se pehle laut-te. Phir un mein se koi Fajr ki namaz ke liye Mina aata, un mein se koi is ke baad aata. Phir jab aate to Jamra ko kankariyan marte. Aur Ibn Umar kehte: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ijazat di thi."
"816","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud se Abd al-Rahman bin Yazid ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne wadi ke pet se kankariyan marein. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman! Beshak log use us ke upar se marte hain. To unhon ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Ye us ka maqam hai jis par Surah Baqara nazil hui (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)."
"817","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud se A'mash ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hajjaj ko mimbar par kehte suna: Wo surat jis mein Baqara ka zikr hai, wo surat jis mein Aal Imran ka zikr hai, aur wo surat jis mein Nisa ka zikr hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne is ka Ibrahim se zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abd al-Rahman bin Yazid ne bayan kiya ke wo Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ke sath they jab unhon ne Jamra al-Aqaba ko kankariyan marein. Phir wadi ke pet mein gaye yahan tak ke darakht ke barabar hue, usے aade rakha. Phir saat kankariyan marein, har kankari ke sath takbeer kehte. Phir farmaya: Yahan se, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi! Wo khada tha jis par Surah Baqara nazil hui (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)."
"818","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehte they: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne hajj mein sar mundwaya."
"819","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Sar mundwane walon par rehem farma. Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur baal katwane walon par, Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Sar mundwane walon par rehem farma. Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur baal katwane walon par, Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Aur baal katwane walon par."
"820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Sar mundwane walon ko bakhsh de. Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur baal katwane walon ko. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Sar mundwane walon ko bakhsh de. Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur baal katwane walon ko. Aap ne ye teen martaba farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: Aur baal katwane walon ko."
"821","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jab apna sar mundwaya to Abu Talha sab se pehle they jinhon ne Aap ke baalon mein se liya."
"822","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hajjat al-Wada mein Mina mein logon ke liye thehre jabke wo Aap se poochhte. Phir Aap ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Mujhe ilm na tha to main ne zibah se pehle sar mundwaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Zibah karo aur koi harj nahi. Phir doosra aaya aur arz kiya: Mujhe ilm na tha to main ne kankariyan marne se pehle zibah kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Kankariyan maro aur koi harj nahi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kisi cheez ke bare mein na poochha gaya jo aage ya peechhe ki gayi magar Aap ne farmaya: Karo aur koi harj nahi."
"823","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zibah, sar mundwane, kankariyan marne, aage aur peechhe karne ke bare mein kaha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi."
"824","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se Abd al-Aziz bin Rufai ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se poochha. Main ne arz kiya: Mujhe koi cheez khabar do jo tum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se yaad rakhi: Aap ne Tarwiya ke din Zuhr aur Asr kahan parhi? Unhon ne kaha: Mina mein. Main ne arz kiya: Phir Aap ne kooch ke din Asr kahan parhi? Unhon ne kaha: Abtah mein. Phir farmaya: Karo jaisa tumhare hukmaran karte hain."
"825","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye to ek manzil thi jismein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) utarte taake Aap ka nikalna aasan ho, matlab Abtah."
"826","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tahseeb kuchh nahi. Wo to ek manzil hai jismein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) utre."
"827","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Nahr ke din ke agle din farmaya jabke Wo Mina mein they: Hum kal Khaif Bani Kinana mein utrenge jahan unhon ne kufr par qasam khayi thi, matlab Muhassab. Aur ye is liye ke Quraish aur Kinana ne Bani Hashim aur Bani Abd al-Muttalib, ya Bani al-Muttalib se ahad kiya tha ke wo un se nikah nahi karenge aur un se khareed-farokht nahi karenge yahan tak ke wo unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) de dein."
"828","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangi ke wo Mina ki raaton mein Makkah mein raat guzarein, apni siqayat ki wajah se. To Aap ne unhe ijazat de di."
"829","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe hukm diya ke wo Aap ki oontniyon par khade hon, aur Aap ki tamam oontniyon ko taqseem karein: Un ke gosht, khaalein aur jhoolein. Aur un ke zibah karne mein kuchh na dein."
"830","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo ek shakhs ke paas aaye jis ne apni oontni bithayi thi aur use zibah kar raha tha. Unhon ne kaha: Use khada karke bandha hua uthao, Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sunnat."
"831","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne hathon se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki oontniyon ke haar bante. Phir Aap ne unhe haar pehnaya, nishan lagaya aur hadi banaya. Phir Aap par koi cheez haram na hui jo Aap ke liye halal thi."
"832","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Ziyad bin Abi Sufyan ne Aisha ko likha: Beshak Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha: Jo hadi bheje us par wo haram ho jata hai jo haji par haram hota hai yahan tak ke us ki hadi zibah ho. To Aisha ne kaha: Jaisa Ibn Abbas ne kaha waisa nahi. Main ne apne hathon se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki hadi ke haar bante. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apne hathon se haar pehnaya. Phir use mere walid ke sath bheja. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par koi cheez haram na hui jo Allah ne halal ki yahan tak ke hadi zibah hui."
"833","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo oontni hank raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho. Us ne arz kiya: Wo oontni hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho. Us ne arz kiya: Wo oontni hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho, tum par afsos, teesri ya doosri martaba."
"834","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo oontni hank raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho. Us ne arz kiya: Wo oontni hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho. Us ne arz kiya: Wo oontni hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawar ho, teen martaba."
"835","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah se ho, magar haiz wali se halka kiya gaya."
"836","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Safiyya bint Huyayy ko haiz aa gaya hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shayad wo hamein roke. Kya wo tumhare sath tawaf na kar chuki? To unhon ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir niklo."
"837","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Safiyya ko kooch ki raat haiz aaya. To unhon ne kaha: Main tumhe rokne wali hi samajhti hun. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Banjar, mundi hui? Kya tum ne Nahr ke din tawaf kiya? Arz kiya gaya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kooch karo."
"838","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bilal se Abdullah bin Umar ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Kaaba mein dakhil hue, jabke Usama bin Zaid, Bilal aur Usman bin Talha al-Hajabi Aap ke sath they. Phir Aap ne use Aap par band kar diya aur us mein thehre. Phir main ne Bilal se poochha jab wo nikle: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne ek sutun apne bayein rakha aur ek sutun apne dayein, aur teen sutun apne peechhe. Aur ghar us din chhe sutunon par tha. Phir namaz parhi."
"839","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghar mein dakhil hue to us ke tamam konon mein dua farmayi aur namaz na parhi yahan tak ke us se nikle. Phir jab Aap nikle to Kaaba ke samne do rakatein parhein. Aur farmaya: Ye Qibla hai."
"840","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne umra kiya. Phir Baitullah ka tawaf kiya aur Maqam ke peechhe do rakatein parhein jabke Aap ke sath logon mein se parda karne wale they. Phir Aap se ek shakhs ne kaha: Kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Kaaba mein dakhil hue? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi."
"841","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum ka kufr naya na hota to main Baitullah ko todta phir use Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ki bunyad par banata. Kyunke Quraish ne us ki imarat chhoti ki aur us ke liye peechhe hissa banaya."
"842","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke tumhari qaum ne jab Kaaba banaya to Ibrahim ki bunyadon se kam kiya? Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum use Ibrahim ki bunyadon par na lautaoge? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum ka kufr naya na hota to main karta. Phir Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha [wo Ibn Umar hain]: Agar Aisha ne ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai to main nahi samajhta ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono ruknon ko chhuna tark kiya jo Hijr se milte hain magar is liye ke ghar Ibrahim ki bunyadon par poora nahi kiya gaya."
"843","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Hateem ke bare mein poochha: Kya wo Baitullah mein se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Main ne arz kiya: Phir unhe kya hua ke unhon ne use Baitullah mein dakhil na kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhari qaum ka kharcha kam pad gaya. Main ne arz kiya: Phir us ke darwaze ka kya haal hai ke uncha hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari qaum ne aisa kiya taake jise chahein dakhil karein aur jise chahein manع karein. Aur agar tumhari qaum ka jahiliyat se ahad naya na hota, aur mujhe dar hai ke un ke dil inkar karein, ke main Hateem ko Baitullah mein dakhil karun aur us ke darwaze ko zameen se mila dun."
"844","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Fadl Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe sawar they. Phir Khath'am mein se ek aurat aayi. Phir Fadl us ki taraf dekhne lage aur wo un ki taraf dekhne lagi. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fadl ka chehra doosri taraf pherne lage. Phir us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ka farz bandon par hajj mein mere walid ko budha paya hai jo sawari par thehar nahi sakte. To kya main un ki taraf se hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Aur ye Hajjat al-Wada mein tha."
"845","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fadl bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hajjat al-Wada ke saal Khath'am mein se ek aurat aayi. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ka farz bandon par hajj mein mere walid ko budha paya hai jo sawari par seedhe nahi baith sakte. To kya un ki taraf se mera hajj karna kafi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"846","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe chhoro jo main ne tumhe chhora. Beshak tum se pehle wale apne sawalon aur apne Ambiya par ikhtilaf se halak hue. Phir jab main tumhe kisi cheez se manع karun to us se bacho. Aur jab main tumhe kisi hukm ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna ho sake karo."
"847","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aurat teen din safar na kare magar mehram ke sath."
"848","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se chaar sune jo mujhe pasand aaye aur achhe lage: Ke aurat do din ki musafat safar na kare jab us ke sath us ka shohar ya mehram na ho. Aur sawariyan teen masjiden ke siwa na bandhi jayein: Masjid al-Haram, meri masjid aur Masjid al-Aqsa."
"849","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman lane wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke wo din raat ki musafat safar kare jab us ke sath mehram na ho."
"850","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Koi mard aurat se tanhayi mein na rahe. Aur koi aurat safar na kare magar us ke sath mehram ho. Phir ek shakhs khada hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Mera naam falan aur falan ladayi mein likha gaya hai, aur meri biwi hajj ke liye nikli hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur apni biwi ke sath hajj karo."
"851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab ladayi, hajj ya umre se laut-te to zameen ke har unche hisse par teen takbeerein kehte. Phir farmate: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Us ke liye badshahi hai aur Us ke liye hamd hai, aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai. Laut-ne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki hamd karne wale. Allah ne apna wada sach kiya, apne bande ki madad ki aur akele girohon ko shikast di."
"852","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Batha mein Dhu al-Hulaifa mein utre aur us mein namaz parhi. Aur Abdullah bin Umar aisa karte."
"853","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ko dekha gaya jabke Wo Dhu al-Hulaifa mein wadi ke pet mein thahre hue they. Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak tum mubarak maidan mein ho [Musa bin Uqba ne kaha, sanad ke ek rawi]: Aur Salim ne hamein bithaya, us thaharne ki jagah talash karte hue jismein Abdullah thaharte they, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke thaharne ki jagah talash karte hue. Jo us masjid se neeche hai jo wadi ke pet mein hai, un ke aur raste ke darmiyan us se darmiyani fasla hai."
"854","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq se Abu Hurairah ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne use us hajj mein bheja jis par Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ameer banaya tha, Hajjat al-Wada se pehle, Nahr ke din, ek jamaat mein, logon mein elan karte hue: Suno! Is saal ke baad mushrik hajj na kare, aur Baitullah ka nanga tawaf na kare."
"855","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Umre se umra tak un ke darmiyan ka kaffara hai. Aur Hajj Mabroor ka badla Jannat ke siwa kuchh nahi."
"856","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo is ghar ka hajj kare aur fahsh-goi na kare aur na-farmani na kare wo aise laute jaisa us din tha jab us ki maan ne use jana tha."
"857","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum Makkah mein apne ghar mein kahan utroge? To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Aqeel ne makanat ya gharon mein se kuchh chhora hai? Aur Aqeel ne Abu Talib ka wirsa paya tha, wo aur Talib. Aur Ja'far aur Ali ne kuchh wirsa na paya, kyunke wo dono musalman they, jabke Aqeel aur Talib kafir they."
"858","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ala bin al-Hadrami (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Muhajir ke liye lautne ke baad teen din hain."
"859","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makkah ki fatah ke din farmaya: Hijrat nahi, lekin jihad aur niyat hai. Aur jab tumhe nikalne ke liye kaha jaye to niklo. Phir beshak ye sheher hai jise Allah ne haram farmaya jis din Us ne aasman aur zameen paida kiye. Aur wo Allah ki hurmat se Qayamat ke din tak haram hai. Aur beshak us mein ladna mere se pehle kisi ke liye halal na hua. Aur mere liye din ki ek ghadi ke siwa halal na hua. Phir wo Allah ki hurmat se Qayamat ke din tak haram hai. Us ke kaante na kaate jayein, us ka shikar na bhagaya jaye, us ki giri hui cheez na uthayi jaye magar jo us ka elan kare. Aur us ki ghaas na kaati jaye. Abbas ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Izkhir ke siwa, kyunke wo un ke loharon aur gharon ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Izkhir ke siwa."
"860","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Amr bin Sa'id se kaha, jab wo Makkah ki taraf lashkar bhej rahe they: Mujhe ijazat dijiye ae ameer ke main tumhe wo qaul bayan karun jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Fatah ke agle din farmaya tha. Mere kanon ne suna, mere dil ne yaad rakha, meri aankhon ne dekha jab Aap ne isے farmaya. Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur sana bayan ki. Phir farmaya: Beshak Makkah ko Allah ne haram farmaya hai, logon ne haram nahi farmaya. Phir Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman lane wale ke liye halal nahi ke us mein khoon bahaye, na us mein darakht kaate. Phir agar koi Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke us mein ladne se rukhsat le to kaho ke Allah ne Apne Rasool ko ijazat di aur tumhe ijazat nahi di. Aur mujhe us mein din ki ek ghadi ijazat di gayi. Phir aaj us ki hurmat kal jaisi ho gayi. Aur hazir ghayab ko pahunchaye. Phir Abu Shuraih se kaha gaya: Amr ne kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Main tum se zyada janta hun ae Shuraih! Wo na-farman ko panah nahi deta, na khoon se bhagne wale ko, na kharabi se bhagne wale ko."
"861","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ne Apne Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par Makkah fatah farmaya to Aap logon mein khade hue aur Allah ki hamd ki aur sana bayan ki. Phir farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Makkah se hathi ko roka, aur us par Apne Rasool aur mominon ko ghalib kiya. Phir wo mere se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi. Aur wo mere liye din ki ek ghadi halal hui. Aur wo mere baad kisi ke liye halal nahi. Phir us ka shikar na bhagaya jaye, us ke kaante na kaate jayein, us ki giri hui cheez halal nahi magar elan karne wale ke liye. Aur jis ka maqtool qatl kiya jaye wo do behtar nazaron mein hai: Ya fidya liya jaye ya qisas liya jaye. Phir Abbas ne kaha: Izkhir ke siwa, kyunke hum use apni qabron aur gharon ke liye banate hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Izkhir ke siwa. Phir Abu Shah khade hue, jo Ahle Yemen mein se ek mard they. Phir unhon ne kaha: Mere liye likho Ya Rasulullah! Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Abu Shah ke liye likho."
"862","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fatah ke saal dakhil hue jabke Aap ke sar par khud tha. Phir jab Aap ne use utaara to ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Beshak Ibn Khatal Kaaba ke pardon se lipta hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo."
"863","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Beshak Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram farmaya aur us ke liye dua ki. Aur main ne Madina ko haram farmaya jaisa Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram farmaya aur us ke liye dua ki, us ke mudd aur sa' mein, jaisa Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ne Makkah ke liye dua ki."
"864","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Talha se farmaya: Apne ladkon mein se ek ladka talash karo jo meri khidmat kare. Phir Abu Talha nikle jabke main un ke peechhe sawar tha. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khidmat karta jab bhi Aap utarte. Phir main Aap ko kasrat se kehte sunta: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, kanjoosi aur buzdili se, qarz ke bojh aur mardon ke ghalbe se. Phir main Aap ki khidmat karta raha yahan tak ke hum Khaibar se laute. Aur Aap Safiyya bint Huyayy ke sath aaye, Aap ne unhe hasil kiya tha. Phir main Aap ko dekhta ke Aap un ke peechhe aba ya chadar se god banate, phir unhe apne peechhe sawar karte. Yahan tak ke jab hum Sahba mein they to Aap ne chamde ke dastarkhwan mein hais banaya. Phir Aap ne mujhe bheja. Phir main ne mardon ko bulaya aur unhon ne khaya. Aur ye Aap ka un se nikah tha. Phir Aap aage badhe yahan tak ke jab Aap ko Uhud zahir hua to Aap ne farmaya: Ye pahad hai jo hum se mohabbat karta hai aur hum us se mohabbat karte hain. Phir jab Aap Madina par chadhe to farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main usے haram farmata hun jo us ke do pahadon ke darmiyan hai, jaisa Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram farmaya. Ae Allah! Un ke mudd aur sa' mein barkat de."
"865","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Asim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Madina ko haram farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, falan se falan tak. Us ke darakht na kaate jayein. Jo us mein nayi cheez nikale us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Asim ne kaha: Phir mujhe Musa bin Anas ne khabar di ke unhon ne kaha, ya nayi cheez wale ko panah de."
"866","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Un ke paimane mein barkat de, un ke sa' aur mudd mein barkat de, matlab Ahle Madina."
"867","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Madina mein dugni barkat farma jo Tune Makkah mein barkat se banayi."
"868","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne eenton ke mimbar par khutba diya jabke Aap par talwar thi jis mein latki hui tehreer thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Hamare paas padhi jane wali kitab mein se Allah ki kitab ke siwa kuchh nahi, aur jo is tehreer mein hai. Phir use khola to us mein oonton ke daant they. Aur us mein: Madina Ayr se falan tak haram hai. Phir jo us mein nayi cheez nikale us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega. Aur us mein: Musalmanon ki panah ek hai, un ka adna use deta hai. Phir jo musalman ki panah tode us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega. Aur us mein: Jo apne aaqaon ki ijazat ke baghair qaum se dosti kare us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai. Allah us se farz aur nafl qubool nahi farmayega."
"869","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo kehte they: Agar main Madina mein hiranon ko charte dekhun to unhe na daraun. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ke dono pathrile kinaron ke darmiyan haram hai."
"870","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamare liye Madina ko mehboob bana jaise Tune hamare liye Makkah ko mehboob banaya ya us se zyada. Aur us ka bukhar Juhfa ki taraf muntaqil farma. Ae Allah! Hamare mudd aur sa' mein barkat de."
"871","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Madina ke raston par farishte hain. Us mein ta'oon aur Dajjal dakhil nahi honge."
"872","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ek basti ka hukm diya gaya hai jo bastiyon ko khayegi. Wo kehte hain Yasrib, jo Madina hai. Wo logon ko nikalti hai jaise bhatti lohe ke mail ko nikalti hai."
"873","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Islam par bai'at ki. Phir dehati ko Madina mein bukhar hua. Phir dehati Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Meri bai'at wapas karo. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne inkar farmaya. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Meri bai'at wapas karo. To Aap ne inkar farmaya. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Meri bai'at wapas karo. To Aap ne inkar farmaya. Phir dehati nikla. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Madina bhatti jaisa hai jo apne mail ko nikalta hai aur us ka umda saaf hota hai."
"874","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Thabit (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo Tayyaba hai jo mail ko nikalta hai jaise aag chandi ke mail ko nikalti hai."
"875","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Ahle Madina se jo fareb kare wo aise pighlega jaise namak pani mein pighalta hai."
"876","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sufyan bin Abi Zuhair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Yemen fatah hoga. Phir ek qaum aayegi jo sawariyan daudayegi. Phir apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhe lekar jayegi, jabke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jante. Aur Sham fatah hoga. Phir ek qaum aayegi jo sawariyan daudayegi. Phir apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhe lekar jayegi, jabke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jante. Aur Iraq fatah hoga. Phir ek qaum aayegi jo sawariyan daudayegi. Phir apne ghar walon aur jo un ki itaat kare unhe lekar jayegi, jabke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar wo jante."
"877","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Wo Madina ko us ki behtareen halat par chhorenge, use darindon aur parindon ke siwa koi nahi aayega, matlab darindon aur parindon ke aane wale. Aur aakhir mein jo hashr kiye jayenge Muzaina ke do charwahe honge jo Madina ka irada karenge, apni bakriyon ko hankte hue. Phir use wehshat-naak payenge. Yahan tak ke jab Thaniyat al-Wada pahunchenge to apne chehron par girenge."
"878","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid al-Mazini (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan Jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai."
"879","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan Jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai. Aur mera mimbar mere Hauz par hai."
"880","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Tabuk ki ladayi se aaye. Yahan tak ke jab hum Madina par chadhe to Aap ne farmaya: Ye Tabah hai. Aur ye Uhud hai, pahad jo hum se mohabbat karta hai aur hum us se mohabbat karte hain."
"881","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz us ke siwa mein hazaar namaz se behtar hai, siwaye Masjid al-Haram ke."
"882","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sawariyan teen masjiden ke siwa na bandhi jayein: Masjid al-Haram, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki masjid aur Masjid al-Aqsa."
"883","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Quba sawar aur paidal tashreef late."
